{aligned}\n$$\n\nWriting the above results in terms of $s,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂f}{∂x} & =s{e}^{\\sqrt{s}}, \\\\ \\frac{∂f}{∂y} & ={e}^{\\sqrt{s}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNext, we take the derivatives of $x$ and $y$ with respect to $s,$ and we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}x}{\\text{d}s}=\\frac{1}{2\\sqrt{s}},\\,\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}s}=1.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, substituting all of our derivatives into the multivariable chain rule, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}f}{\\text{d}s} & =\\frac{∂f}{∂x}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}x}{\\text{d}s}+\\frac{∂f}{∂y}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}s} \\\\  & =s{e}^{\\sqrt{s}}\\cdot \\frac{1}{2\\sqrt{s}}+{e}^{\\sqrt{s}}\\cdot 1 \\\\  & =\\frac{\\sqrt{s}}{2}{e}^{\\sqrt{s}}+{e}^{\\sqrt{s}} \\\\  & =(1+\\frac{\\sqrt{s}}{2}){e}^{\\sqrt{s}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186385839 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186385840 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186385839 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186385841 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186385839 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186385842 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186385839 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186385843 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186385839 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186385844 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186385839 #edb/ref 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186385839 #edb/ref 1077 "selection" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186385839 #edb/ref 1078 #edb/ref 17592186385844 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186385839 #edb/ref 1079 #uuid "8f70704d-2718-514e-b670-1b5ed75416ae" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186385840 #edb/ref 1080 "(1+\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{s}}){e}^{\\sqrt{s}}" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186385840 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186385840 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "247ee7d0-904c-5d01-8297-06a98015037c" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186385841 #edb/ref 1080 "(1+s){e}^{\\sqrt{s}}" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186385841 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186